# --- what stays on this machine ---
# Working notes, the engineering log, and the scrapers you actually run. The
# repo ships the tool; what you point it at is yours.
local/

# Scrapers are user data. `scrapers/` is kept, its contents are not.
scrapers/*
!scrapers/.gitkeep
